WEBVTT

00:35.540 --> 00:39.260
except when I actually need him.

00:54.390 --> 00:55.270
Priecia.

00:57.410 --> 00:58.240
Taking a walk?

01:04.030 --> 01:08.380
I'm too nervous to sleep.

01:08.660 --> 01:09.740
No wonder.

01:10.490 --> 01:15.550
Finally, we're going into our enemy's base, the sacred grounds called Resrexion, tomorrow.

01:15.780 --> 01:16.300
But ̶

01:16.300 --> 01:17.630
Don't say the rest.

01:18.100 --> 01:20.350
I know it, but...

01:20.850 --> 01:24.090
that's why we have to rest as much as possible.

01:25.480 --> 01:27.780
Otherwise, tomorrow's battle will be painful.

01:30.210 --> 01:31.450
Won't it?

01:34.920 --> 01:38.580
Though it's a desert here, it gets colder than expected at night, doesn't it?

01:38.580 --> 01:42.120
Yeah, I've heard about it in Ms. Litte's lesson, however...

01:42.930 --> 01:45.150
I never thought that it would get this cold.

01:46.060 --> 01:47.920
Mind if I sit next to you?

01:50.360 --> 01:52.700
Don't misunderstand me.

01:52.700 --> 01:55.940
I only asked since we'd surely get warmer this way.

01:56.950 --> 01:57.750
Right.

02:00.580 --> 02:04.970
After tomorrow's battle is over, what are you going to do, Hyaweh?

02:06.180 --> 02:10.960
Well, if I return to Windland, I'd like to eat, sleep, and play as much as I want.

02:11.970 --> 02:13.760
You sound just like a child.

02:13.760 --> 02:14.730
And after that?

02:16.400 --> 02:23.050
Even though the school has been destroyed, I’ll still continue training to become a great knight.

02:23.610 --> 02:26.540
I want to become stronger than I am now and…

02:27.710 --> 02:30.900
I will become a knight for the
sake of protecting everything.

02:32.990 --> 02:36.920
If it's you, I'm sure you can become one.

02:36.920 --> 02:38.480
You should be proud of yourself.

02:39.510 --> 02:44.540
You're strong, and from this day on, you'll become even stronger than you are now.

02:44.540 --> 02:51.010
Thank you, but right now, I can only protect one girl with all of my might.

02:51.650 --> 02:53.600
So you can call me a half-knight!

02:54.360 --> 02:57.520
The promise you made that day...

02:57.520 --> 02:59.220
I can believe in it, right?

03:00.050 --> 03:00.650
Yeah.

03:17.250 --> 03:20.910
You dodged it well… is what I said, but...

03:22.960 --> 03:26.860
You would have been happier if you had just died.

03:27.170 --> 03:28.420
Sister Hell!

03:28.860 --> 03:30.000
Why are you here?!

03:30.300 --> 03:31.180
Why?

03:31.710 --> 03:35.280
It's because I'm a warrior hired by Sablum.

03:38.860 --> 03:47.190
Alas, until the ground is soaked with the blood of every last fool who worships the god Lelihion,

03:47.510 --> 03:51.400
my mission... will never end!

03:53.050 --> 03:54.260
Geez...

03:55.240 --> 03:59.280
Every time we're enjoying a romantic time together, enemies come out of nowhere.

04:00.120 --> 04:02.510
Maybe it's too romantic for them to tolerate.

04:03.080 --> 04:05.090
Is it? Well, that's okay.

04:05.630 --> 04:06.800
Let's go, Hyaweh!

04:07.210 --> 04:08.010
Yeah!

04:13.690 --> 04:16.980
The Knight's Battlefield

04:20.080 --> 04:26.990
<i>Our native land is overflowing with a gentle wind blowing through the vast sky.</i>

04:27.800 --> 04:35.960
<i>Neighboring countries, in awe of the Kingdom of the Wind, Windland, call it the Kingdom of Knights.</i>

04:37.530 --> 04:39.230
<i>My name is Komet.</i>

04:40.140 --> 04:45.510
<i>Inside this windmill, I have assisted everyone who has aimed toward becoming a knight.</i>

04:48.080 --> 04:49.510
<i>I have seen it here.</i>

04:50.660 --> 04:58.570
<i>People with shining swords choosing the path of knighthood, so now I can tell the reason why they became a knight.</i>

04:58.910 --> 05:09.430
<i>Hey, you who are in a dream right now, if my words can reach you, please listen to me for a while...</i>

05:11.690 --> 05:23.720
<i>about the story of the relationship between your father and mother, the past princess of Windland, Princea.</i>

05:35.740 --> 05:44.850
<i>The war over Resrexion had sacrificed many soldiers' lives for hundreds of years.</i>

05:46.600 --> 05:52.850
<i>Considering the holy war between believers in both Lelihion from Crusade, and Salus from the Sablum Empire,</i>

05:53.170 --> 05:57.000
<i>Gustav, who was the king of Windland at the time,</i>

05:58.820 --> 06:05.080
<i>claimed that the war was just so pointless that it had been wrecking the countries and exhausting the nations in vain,</i>

06:05.080 --> 06:11.780
<i>and persuaded his allies to cease the crusade.</i>

06:14.200 --> 06:19.490
<i>Since each county in favor of Lelihion sympathized with Gustav's statement,</i>

06:19.740 --> 06:26.040
<i>and the Sablum Empire, which was as exhausted as our country after that long-term war,</i>

06:26.040 --> 06:30.890
<i>supposedly had intentions of reinforcing armaments while suspending hostilities.</i>

06:30.890 --> 06:34.660
<i>It was unexpectedly easy that both camps reached a truce.</i>

06:34.660 --> 06:38.410
<i>And so, the peaceful period of Windland had begun at last.</i>

06:41.990 --> 06:43.670
Glow Lash!

06:51.220 --> 06:53.540
Critical Break!

06:54.510 --> 06:55.770
Keep it up, Priecia!

06:57.120 --> 06:58.150
Yes!

07:05.310 --> 07:06.250
Prism?!

07:06.510 --> 07:07.780
They have a magic user?!

07:08.830 --> 07:09.530
Shoot them!

07:19.660 --> 07:23.520
<i>A dozen of years have passed since the end of hostilities.</i>

07:25.280 --> 07:34.100
<i>On the day King Gustav's daughter, Princea, was riding with her younger brother, Hans, who has a weak body,</i>

07:34.350 --> 07:39.500
<i>on the trip for his health to Agartha, which is far from the royal capital, where they can enjoy clear air.</i>

07:41.450 --> 07:50.740
<i>I'm not a god, so I don't know if her fateful encounter with that person was simply coincidence or just god's will.</i>

08:02.890 --> 08:10.570
<i>Who could know just an encounter would lead to the beginning of a story about a war of knights...</i>

08:10.570 --> 08:15.630
<i>who fought for the sake of Windland— no, the whole world.</i>

08:29.890 --> 08:37.050
<i>Just as windmills don't know from where or when the wind will rotate them when they were made,</i>

08:37.490 --> 08:44.370
<i>I'm sure the encounter was also known as the wind named Destiny, blown by a divine being.</i>

08:50.240 --> 08:55.360
Sink into the vain darkness with your evil creed and love that will never be granted.

08:59.060 --> 09:05.560
Obey my words and gather in my hand. The calm sea of prosperity, the repose of Undine as Mother Sea.

09:06.120 --> 09:08.950
Frost Buster!

09:14.630 --> 09:18.310
Hyaweh! Priecia!

09:18.310 --> 09:19.220
Fel!

09:19.220 --> 09:20.830
Thank you! You saved us!

09:22.360 --> 09:23.330
Calm down.

09:23.810 --> 09:26.260
There's only one magic user on the enemy's side.

09:26.260 --> 09:28.580
Stay close to me in order to prevent
friendly fire casualties!

09:34.350 --> 09:35.130
Who's there?!

09:38.050 --> 09:43.300
I will not forgive anyone who tries to hurt Lady Priecia.

09:45.620 --> 09:46.390
Kagura!

09:47.820 --> 09:50.390
Mibu style, hidden sword technique!

09:51.210 --> 09:52.970
Ryuugazan!

09:51.210 --> 09:52.970
Dragon Fang Slash

09:57.110 --> 09:58.700
It's... Karin...

10:01.220 --> 10:02.200
Instructor!

10:06.470 --> 10:07.800
I wanted to see you again.

10:08.040 --> 10:12.590
Let's bring our unsettled battle to an end right here, right now!

10:12.590 --> 10:13.550
Karin...

10:15.450 --> 10:17.600
You will never know.

10:17.600 --> 10:19.900
I hear the voices of those child victims at that time...

10:19.900 --> 10:22.900
They whisper to me every night in my dreams...

10:24.490 --> 10:26.170
"Don't forgive you!"

10:27.130 --> 10:32.350
"Send you into the the depths of hell!"

10:38.360 --> 10:40.390
Hans! That's wrong!

10:40.830 --> 10:42.830
Don't just swing the net around with your arm!

10:43.230 --> 10:48.770
Use your hips! With that kind of weak posture, you can't become a great knight!

10:49.420 --> 10:50.780
Yes, I understand!

10:53.280 --> 10:54.840
That's right! Just like that!

10:55.600 --> 10:58.100
You can do it, Hans!

10:59.750 --> 11:05.040
<i>Probably because they were children of similar ages, they instantly became friends.</i>

11:06.680 --> 11:10.470
Hey, what were you two talking about just now?

11:11.270 --> 11:13.520
It's a secret conversation, okay?

11:13.670 --> 11:15.020
Oh, yeah...

11:15.020 --> 11:18.380
Secret? I know a secret too!

11:18.900 --> 11:23.970
You know, Meister Onii-chan likes Onee-chan.

11:26.270 --> 11:30.040
Hey, Hans! I told you that was a secret just between us!

11:30.700 --> 11:35.300
But Onee-chan always says that she wants to become Meister Onii-chan's bride.

11:35.300 --> 11:39.040
So I thought it wasn't a secret anymo ̶

11:40.210 --> 11:44.750
Hans! Ahh, Hans! I told you that it's a secret!

11:46.740 --> 11:50.350
B-Bride... Mine?

11:59.870 --> 12:03.590
<i>That was a brilliant time, as if it was a sweet dream.</i>

12:04.170 --> 12:08.770
<i>But, the happier the days are, the faster they pass.</i>

12:08.770 --> 12:12.160
<i>And every dream must come to an end.</i>

12:12.800 --> 12:17.250
<i>But having a dreamlike time, they didn't know about that.</i>

12:19.270 --> 12:23.970
<i>And then, the day when dreams end suddenly arrived.</i>

12:26.020 --> 12:31.340
Tomorrow... tomorrow... I need to go back...

12:32.360 --> 12:33.190
...to Freeden.

12:34.440 --> 12:36.960
I see, you're going home...

12:37.640 --> 12:39.940
How should I say it... I...

12:41.440 --> 12:45.910
I will... never forget about you!

13:10.130 --> 13:14.480
I never thought that you would even come to this place...

13:14.860 --> 13:19.410
I will never let you reach the palace.

13:23.920 --> 13:25.610
This voice... don't tell me...

13:25.610 --> 13:26.660
An Angel!

13:46.710 --> 13:50.400
Seems it's about time I bid you farewell.

13:56.850 --> 13:57.930
Good-bye.

14:02.970 --> 14:05.310
Onii-chan really isn't coming...

14:18.040 --> 14:18.750
Princea!

14:24.230 --> 14:25.830
Ah, it's Onii-chan!

14:27.050 --> 14:30.050
Princea! Hans!

14:30.370 --> 14:33.060
Onii-chan! Onii-chan!

14:33.860 --> 14:35.600
Hans, let's make a promise!

14:35.600 --> 14:38.300
I will try my best to become a knight.

14:38.300 --> 14:42.060
That's why you should quickly get
better and become a knight!

14:42.480 --> 14:48.010
Yes, I understand! We will become knights together! It's a promise!

14:48.340 --> 14:49.360
Meister!

14:50.190 --> 14:51.370
Princea!

14:55.120 --> 14:57.300
Princea, I... I...

14:59.740 --> 15:01.640
...love you!

15:06.450 --> 15:10.380
When I become a knight, I will come see you!

15:10.570 --> 15:13.420
Yeah, I will be waiting.

15:13.420 --> 15:16.680
I will certainly be your bride!

15:17.000 --> 15:21.460
Yeah, and by that time, I will never
let you go with this hand!

15:29.120 --> 15:30.740
Onii-chan...

15:36.410 --> 15:38.450
This is god's judgment.

15:54.960 --> 16:02.420
<i>Only one year after they promised
to meet again, that happened...</i>

16:15.560 --> 16:16.670
Kagura!

16:20.170 --> 16:21.020
The crystal...

16:26.290 --> 16:30.590
The barrier is cracking! What should we do?!

16:31.050 --> 16:34.460
At this rate, we can't retreat or even attack back!

16:35.180 --> 16:38.440
Ah, it's over! We'll get smashed!

16:42.180 --> 16:43.990
My... limit...

16:44.530 --> 16:45.560
The crystal...

16:46.610 --> 16:49.380
There’s only one chance for us to break the crystal.

16:49.820 --> 16:53.750
There will be a delay before the fist reaches us.

16:54.520 --> 16:59.500
In the mean time, Fel and Instructor, please stop its move using your magic and swords.

16:59.920 --> 17:03.990
Then, Priecia and I will destroy that prism on its forehead!

17:04.220 --> 17:06.540
Hyaweh, but that's still...

17:06.540 --> 17:08.170
It's impossible without practice.

17:08.240 --> 17:12.050
We can! We can do it. Believe in yourself!

17:12.920 --> 17:14.050
Believe...

17:14.800 --> 17:16.050
in your friends' will!

17:18.250 --> 17:19.060
Yes!

17:19.890 --> 17:21.280
How stubborn...

17:21.990 --> 17:22.560
Balziel!

17:26.320 --> 17:26.810
Now!

17:27.320 --> 17:29.450
Ice Javelin!

17:34.170 --> 17:36.230
Souha, Enhazan!

17:34.170 --> 17:36.230
Twin Blade, Supreme Flame Slash

17:54.330 --> 17:57.390
<i>Hans, I... will not cry anymore.</i>

17:58.220 --> 18:00.420
<i>I will become a knight...</i>

18:00.420 --> 18:04.430
<i>I will become a knight to see the things you wanted to see...</i>

18:04.430 --> 18:06.810
<i>to grasp the things you wanted to grasp.</i>

18:07.140 --> 18:08.130
<i>And...</i>

18:09.870 --> 18:15.030
<i>I will walk the path which you wished to walk.</i>

18:30.970 --> 18:33.150
On that day, I promised you, right?

18:34.230 --> 18:35.900
No matter what happens...

18:36.320 --> 18:39.080
I will never let go of your hand.

18:40.730 --> 18:45.730
Yes. You should hold my hand tightly, Hyaweh!

19:13.820 --> 19:14.590
<i>Hans...</i>

19:15.270 --> 19:17.920
<i>Look at me, Hans.</i>

19:18.500 --> 19:21.420
<i>Onee-chan is doing her best for Hans' part.</i>

19:27.760 --> 19:30.080
<i>The promise that you aren't able to fulfill,</i>

19:31.430 --> 19:32.960
<i>I will make sure...</i>

19:35.640 --> 19:37.390
<i>to fulfill it with that person.</i>

19:41.610 --> 19:42.960
You over there...

19:42.960 --> 19:43.950
Who are you?!

19:57.090 --> 20:00.630
<i>Yesterday, today, tomorrow, and the future...</i>

20:00.630 --> 20:04.930
<i>The wind blows eternally and continues to turn the windmill.</i>

20:04.930 --> 20:10.870
<i>Time continues to flow from the past to the future, and the clock's needle remains in motion.</i>

20:12.530 --> 20:18.040
<i>I wonder where the wind that blows against the future of those young brave knights came from,</i>

20:18.040 --> 20:23.930
<i>and when it starts to revolve the fans of their destiny.</i>

20:32.250 --> 20:33.220
We did it!

20:33.220 --> 20:34.090
Yes.

20:34.730 --> 20:36.940
Strong, as expected.

20:37.990 --> 20:42.200
Now I understand why that person
told me not to underestimate you.

20:43.170 --> 20:46.940
But this is just the beginning...

20:47.910 --> 20:50.070
of the real battle.

21:18.150 --> 21:20.050
Just a little more.

21:23.360 --> 21:23.970
Okay?

21:25.310 --> 21:27.960
Yes. Just a little more!

21:39.560 --> 21:44.440
<i>Guided by time, what kind of future will the knights witness?</i>

21:45.100 --> 21:46.060


21:46.060 --> 21:56.740
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

22:03.080 --> 22:09.560
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

22:09.660 --> 22:16.660
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

22:17.490 --> 22:24.860
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

22:25.030 --> 22:28.170
If my wish comes true...

22:28.170 --> 22:34.920
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

22:34.920 --> 22:41.640
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

22:41.640 --> 22:51.150
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

22:51.460 --> 22:58.180
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

22:58.470 --> 23:08.860
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

23:14.970 --> 23:17.770
Next Episode

23:15.880 --> 23:22.320
That was my first time that I’ve felt embarrassed. That day, that experience, the feeling of that hand...

23:22.920 --> 23:25.920
W-What am I talking about?!

23:26.680 --> 23:31.550
Everything's his fault! How dare he embarrass me!

23:31.550 --> 23:34.080
More or less, I'm going to slash that man with my sword!

23:34.340 --> 23:36.350
Next time, The Knight's Academy.

23:34.560 --> 23:39.060
The Knight's Academy

23:36.350 --> 23:38.630
Shine, the prism of heart!
